assert `: list posof "foreign" in j2_x30' == 0
display "JSE-30 PASS: if ~foreign names foreign, and Stata answers it"
capture dash clear

// JSE-31 -- a Unicode variable name, e-acute + "tranger", is read,
// evaluated in Stata (not exported: WP-27), and both modes draw Stata's
// rows.  Made with uchar(233), so
// this file stays ASCII.
